                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've recently played though about a half-dozen games by developer Astro Port. This is the only one I found really enjoyable. There were a couple that were okay to meh (Armed Seven, Supercharged Robot Vulkaiser), but most SUCKED (Satazius, Steel Strider, Gigantic Army). So if you've tried those games and avoid their games (wise), you may want to at least give this shooter a shot. It's like a poor man's Twin Cobra.",
